1
00:00:00,999 --> 00:00:02,419
(Girl:)Curious George is a monkey.

2
00:00:02,959 --> 00:00:06,629
(Sheldon:)Somewhat anthropomorphized, but yes.

3
00:00:07,255 --> 00:00:09,095
(Sheldon:)Say...

4
00:00:09,257 --> 00:00:11,927
(Sheldon:)...maybe sometime you and I
could go see monkeys together.

5
00:00:12,094 --> 00:00:14,094
(Sheldon:)- Would you like that?
- Okay.

6
00:00:14,680 --> 00:00:16,260
(Leonard:)Sheldon, what are you doing?

7
00:00:16,932 --> 00:00:19,102
(Sheldon:)I'm making friends with this little girl.

8
00:00:19,267 --> 00:00:20,937
(Sheldon:)- What's your name?
- Rebecca.

9
00:00:21,103 --> 00:00:23,433
(Sheldon:)Hi, Rebecca.
I'm your new friend, Sheldon.

10
00:00:23,605 --> 00:00:25,145
- No, you're not. Let's go.
- I...

11
00:00:25,982 --> 00:00:27,402
(Sheldon:)We were really hitting it off.

12
00:00:27,567 --> 00:00:29,607
(Leonard:)Don't look up, there's cameras.

13
00:00:34,449 --> 00:00:37,329
I'm curious, in the "How Well Do
You Know Sheldon?" section...

14
00:00:37,494 --> 00:00:40,084
...what did you put
for his favorite amino acid?

15
00:00:41,373 --> 00:00:42,503
(Leonard and Howard:)Lysine.

16
00:00:42,666 --> 00:00:44,496
(Raj:)Damn it, I had lysine and changed it.

17
00:00:45,293 --> 00:00:47,213
Oh, good. You're just in time.

18
00:00:47,379 --> 00:00:51,549
(Sheldon:)I believe I've isolated the algorithm
for making friends.

19
00:00:51,717 --> 00:00:54,637
(Leonard:)Sheldon, there is no algorithm
for making friends.

20
00:00:54,803 --> 00:00:58,303
Hear him out. If he's onto something,
we could open a booth at Comic-Con...

21
00:00:58,473 --> 00:01:00,143
(Howard:)...make a fortune.

